id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
29806::$$$message_0218_0000_0000$$$::The curtain falls.[lr]::
29807::$$$message_0218_0000_0001$$$::A buzzer sounds the end of the play, and the house sinks into darkness.[lr]::
29808::$$$message_0218_0000_0002$$$::The slumber is deep. We won't reawaken until the morning of the fifth day.::
29809::$$$message_0218_0001_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
29810::$$$message_0218_0001_0001$$$::There's no one to say farewell to.[lr]::
29811::$$$message_0218_0001_0002$$$::I have nothing to take back with me. I pass through the gate, just as I've done many times before.::
29812::$$$message_0218_0002_0000$$$::Soon, the date will change.[lr]::
29813::$$$message_0218_0002_0001$$$::The black moon turns to kill me for remaining until the fourth night.[lr]::
29814::$$$message_0218_0002_0002$$$::Now I go to destroy its source.::
29815::$$$message_0218_0003_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
29816::$$$message_0218_0003_0001$$$::I suppress a scream and press on.[lr]::
29817::$$$message_0218_0003_0002$$$::I can reach the empty sky from this tower.[lr]::
29818::$$$message_0218_0003_0003$$$::Now that I'm aware of what I am, the path to return to where I belong should appear...::
29819::$$$message_0218_0004_0000$$$::Midnight comes.[lr]::
29820::$$$message_0218_0004_0001$$$::The atmosphere warps, time becomes vague, and I morph into something else.[lr]::
29821::$$$message_0218_0004_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
29822::$$$message_0218_0004_0003$$$::My chest is hot.[lr]::
29823::$$$message_0218_0004_0004$$$::I must be breathing fast. [noise monocro=1 type=ltDodge opacity=220]My one heart can't keep up at all.[stopnoise]::
29824::$$$message_0218_0005_0000$$$::"[se volume=60 storage=se616.wav]......"[rf][lr]::
29825::$$$message_0218_0005_0001$$$::I abandon shouting and move forward.[lr]::
29826::$$$message_0218_0005_0002$$$::...As I tHoUGHT, thiS iS thE BOTTom of tHe WORlD. bLack THReadS STrEtCh oUt frOm thE POiNt wHeRE EVErYTHInG BEgAn.[lr]::
29827::$$$message_0218_0005_0003$$$::...Red light illuminates the sleeping town.[lr]::
29828::$$$message_0218_0005_0004$$$::Mixed in with the fierce wind is the familiar sound of[lr]::
29829::$$$message_0218_0005_0005$$$::resentment belonging to what used to be me.::
29830::$$$message_0218_0006_0000$$$::"...!"[lr]::
29831::$$$message_0218_0006_0001$$$::The voice urges me to look down.[lr]::
29832::$$$message_0218_0006_0002$$$::...It's coming.[lr]::
29833::$$$message_0218_0006_0003$$$::A god of the sea approaches from that mountain of corpses.[lr]::
29834::$$$message_0218_0006_0004$$$::Terrifying antipathy and envy.[lr]::
29835::$$$message_0218_0006_0005$$$::It overflows, trying to pull in what used to be me as its ally.::
29836::$$$message_0218_0007_0000$$$::"Ha...ngh, [noise opacity=168]aaah!"[stopnoise][lr]::
29837::$$$message_0218_0007_0001$$$::I run for the stairs.[lr]::
29838::$$$message_0218_0007_0002$$$::I hAvE to hURRy. i Need TO run bEFORe tHey caTCH mE. [fadebgm time=100 volume=30][seloop storage=se407.wav]RuN, [wait canskip=0 time=500]RuN...[sestop storage=se407.wav time=100 nowait=1][fadebgm time=100 volume=100][lr]::
29839::$$$message_0218_0007_0003$$$::                          "RUN? WHat dO you THINK YOU'rE doING?"[rf][lr]::
29840::$$$message_0218_0007_0004$$$::   ruN...[fadebgm time=100 volume=30][seloop storage=se407.wav]I...I HaVE To PuT aN enD to THiS drEam...::
29841::$$$message_0218_0008_0000$$$::...My vision is fading.[lr]::
29842::$$$message_0218_0008_0001$$$::It's not that I'm losing the ability to see. The function of "seeing" itself is returning to nothingness.[lr]::
29843::$$$message_0218_0008_0002$$$::"YEs... YOU tHInk we'Ll leT you END iT?"[rf][lr]::
29844::$$$message_0218_0008_0003$$$::I cover my ears against the cries coming from within, and crawl up the stairs.::
29845::$$$message_0218_0009_0000$$$::SO fAR.[lr]::
29846::$$$message_0218_0009_0001$$$::i cAn't REacH ThE ToP.[lr]::
29847::$$$message_0218_0009_0002$$$::I doN'T HavE tHE WiLl To Make it all ThE WaY.::
29848::$$$message_0218_0010_0000$$$::"A[line len=2]GIH, HiEEE...!"[rf][lr]::
29849::$$$message_0218_0010_0001$$$::TheY'rE GOInG TO caTCh mE.[lr]::
29850::$$$message_0218_0010_0002$$$::a HorDE Of HuSks PackS the STairs cIrCLing THe Tower.[lr]::
29851::$$$message_0218_0010_0003$$$::"GEEEH...[cacheimage storage=red2][wvl][fadebgm time=100 volume=30][seloop storage=se407.wav][noise monocro=1 type=ltDodge opacity=220][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=0 top=0 time=3000 accel=0 storage=red2][font color=0xEF0326]GAAAAAAAHHH!"[rf]::
29852::$$$message_0218_0011_0000$$$::befoRe I Know iT, thE cHOrus is COMiNg from my liPS, Too.[lr]::
29853::$$$message_0218_0011_0001$$$::The BlaCk MooN turNs.[lr]::
29854::$$$message_0218_0011_0002$$$::the nEW ME rEACHEs mY POsItIon.::
29855::$$$message_0218_0012_0000$$$::AhH... i'M SO JEaLous.[lr]::
29856::$$$message_0218_0012_0001$$$::i FaILed. I faIleD. i faileD.[lr]::
29857::$$$message_0218_0012_0002$$$::TheN...[lr]::
29858::$$$message_0218_0012_0003$$$::yOU shoULd FAIL aND beCOMe A mOnSteR, jUST LIkE MEâ€¦::
929831::$$$message_9218_0006_0001$$$::The voice urges me to look down.[r]::
